    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "pan-spread-left",
    "sfx": null,
    "text": "For eleven solid years, the hyper-realistic VR game 'Tower of Trials' drove millions of players to complete despair.",
    "audio_file": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/audio/line_01.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 6.79,
    "duration_frames": 207,
    "pagePath": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/chapter_1/panels/panel_001.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": "02",
    "act": 1,
    "ch": 1,
    "panel": "panel_005.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "sfx": null,
    "text": "Its absurd difficulty made everyone quit. Everyone, except for a single gaming Nutuber named Jinhyuk Kang.",
    "audio_file": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/audio/line_02.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 6.72,
    "duration_frames": 205,
    "pagePath": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/chapter_1/panels/panel_005.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": "03",
    "act": 1,
    "ch": 1,
    "panel": "panel_012.jpg",
    "speaker": "Jinhyuk",
    "motion": "zoom-top-to-bottom",
    "sfx": "sfx_sword_slash.wav",
    "text": "Eleven years of grinding. Finally... the final floor is cleared. Game over.",
    "audio_file": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/audio/line_03.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 5.98,
    "duration_frames": 183,
    "pagePath": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/chapter_1/panels/panel_012.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": "04",
    "act": 1,
    "ch": 1,
    "panel": "panel_020.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "sfx": null,
    "text": "Jinhyuk uploaded his ending video to celebrate, planning to retire and find a real job.",
    "audio_file": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/audio/line_04.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 5.16,
    "duration_frames": 158,
    "pagePath": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/chapter_1/panels/panel_020.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": "05",
    "act": 1,
    "ch": 1,
    "panel": "panel_032.jpg",
    "speaker": "System",
    "motion": "zoom-top-to-bottom",
    "sfx": "sfx_magic_blast.wav",
    "text": "Notice. The Tower of Trials service has concluded. Rebooting reality to match game parameters in three, two, one.",
    "audio_file": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/audio/line_05.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 8.45,
    "duration_frames": 257,
    "pagePath": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/chapter_1/panels/panel_032.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": "06",
    "act": 1,
    "ch": 1,
    "panel": "panel_042.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "pan-spread-left",
    "sfx": null,
    "text": "A colossal black spire thousands of meters high pierced the sky over the city. The game was now real life.",
    "audio_file": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/audio/line_06.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 6.58,
    "duration_frames": 201,
    "pagePath": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/chapter_1/panels/panel_042.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": "07",
    "act": 2,
    "ch": 2,
    "panel": "panel_002.jpg",
    "speaker": "System",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "sfx": "sfx_level_up.wav",
    "text": "Player Kang Jinhyuk identified. You are the sole survivor who witnessed the ending. Hidden class 'Unknown' granted.",
    "audio_file": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/audio/line_07.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 7.51,
    "duration_frames": 229,
    "pagePath": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/chapter_2/panels/panel_002.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": "08",
    "act": 2,
    "ch": 2,
    "panel": "panel_015.jpg",
    "speaker": "Jinhyuk",
    "motion": "zoom-top-to-bottom",
    "sfx": null,
    "text": "Class Unknown? And my innate ability is the 'Eyes of Gluttony'?! I can copy and steal any target's skills!",
    "audio_file": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/audio/line_08.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 7.27,
    "duration_frames": 222,
    "pagePath": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/chapter_2/panels/panel_015.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": "09",
    "act": 2,
    "ch": 2,
    "panel": "panel_030.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "sfx": null,
    "text": "While regular players panicked in the streets, Jinhyuk packed his survival gear and headed straight toward the Tower entrance.",
    "audio_file": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/audio/line_09.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 6.24,
    "duration_frames": 191,
    "pagePath": "Solo_Max_Level_Newbie/chapter_2/panels/panel_030.jpg"
  },
  {
